:::text id=caegvWu038 at=top-center width=86% height=144 offsetY=64 preset=title align=left
# Code review
:::

:::code id=9Ek7ojgGPK at=center width=80% offsetY=24 language=diff
- function compute(n: number) {
-   return n * 2 + 1;
- }
+ function compute(n: number): number {
+   if (!Number.isFinite(n)) {
+     throw new TypeError('compute() expected a finite number');
+   }
+   return n * 2 + 1;
+ }
:::

:::text id=1JaSv8z0uS at=bottom-center width=80% height=120 offsetY=-56 preset=caption align=center color=muted
Added an explicit return type and a guard against NaN/±Infinity inputs.
:::
